## 2. LLM ports

| Port | Engine | Model | Projector |
|------|--------|-------|-----------|
| **8080** | QWEN35 (orchestrator) | `Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf` | **none** (early-fusion) |
| **8081** | Coder utility | `qwen2.5-coder-7b-instruct-q5_k_m.gguf` | none |
| **8082** | Vision utility | `Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-Q4_K_M.gguf` | `mmproj-F16.gguf` |

- Default launcher: `Start_Local_LLM.bat` → ENGINE=QWEN35, `CACHE_K=bf16`, `CACHE_V=bf16`
- Utility pool: `Start_Utility_Agents.bat` → 8081 + 8082

## 3. Workflow remaps

| Suite | Workflow | Model | Latent lock |
|-------|----------|-------|-------------|
| Image Studio | `flux_lite_image.json` | `flux1-dev-Q4_K_M.gguf` + clip_l + t5xxl_fp8 | 1024×1024 T2I |
| Video T2V / GIF | `wan_video.json`, `gif_studio.json` | `wan2.1_t2v_1.3B_FP8.safetensors` | T2V default **832×480**, GIF **512×512** |
| Video I2V | `wan_i2v_14b.json` | `wan2.1_i2v_14B_480p_Q4_K_M.gguf` | **hard-lock 832×480** |
| Shorts vertical | VideoStudio / stitcher | same Wan family | **480×832** vertical crop |

## 4. 8GB rules

- Native VRAM video: ≤49 frames / ≤3s @ 16fps / ≤832×480  
- Spillover: ≤81 frames / ≤5s / ≤640×480 (≥32GB system RAM)  
- Never run Wan 14B I2V concurrently with utility agents on 8081/8082 if VRAM is tight  
- Flux → resize to 832×480 before Wan I2V (do not feed 1024×1024 into 14B)

## 5. Server code touchpoints

- `server/agent/AgentModelRouter.ts` — multi-port catalog, QWEN35 `hasVisionAdapter: false`  
- `server.ts` — Wan frame binding + duration normalize (max 5s, no silent 1s trim)  
- `server/comfy/WorkflowParser.ts` — `frames` → `length` binding  

